"creator/commit/9133b1516>`__), mit nativen ``libpython3.13``- und "
"``ujson``-Shared-Libraries (`d3aa663d8 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/d3aa663d8>`__, `a2cb24e74 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
