"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/069807cd3>`__, `5f2e45196 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5f2e45196>`__, `3b6c6c312 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/3b6c6c312>`__)."

